  "worked_solution": "To subtract $5$ from $0$, we start at $0$ on the number line and move $5$ places to the left. \n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14132866/assets/412a35ebeaecf837bcb97fe405ac0a6bf2d73652c88d505c3baad34cfe744fde.png)\n\nThis gives $0-5=-5.$",
